# Stripe Platform Billing

- Read `docs/engineering/stripe-platform-billing.md` before making non-trivial Stripe or platform billing changes.
- Verify external API field limits before shipping changes to Stripe request payloads.
- Keep long IDs in Stripe `metadata`, not display `name` fields.
- Reuse shared helpers for Stripe-safe names or constrained fields instead of open-coding strings.
- Add or update handler-level tests when webhook provisioning behavior changes.
- Add or update outcome tests when invitation or account lifecycle state changes.
- Run the relevant billing tests and `npm run test:platform` before closeout.
